<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Privacy Policy | Legal Rights Explained</title>
    <style>
      * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
      body { font-family: Georgia, serif; background: #f0f4f8; }
      header { background: #1a3a5c; padding: 28px 20px; text-align: center; border-bottom: 3px solid #c9a84c; }
      .header-tag { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #c9a84c; margin-bottom: 6px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; }
      header h1 { font-size: 1.6rem; color: white; font-weight: normal; }
      nav { background: #152d47; display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 28px; padding: 10px; }
      nav a { color: #a8c4e0; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; }
      nav a:hover { color: #c9a84c; }
      main { max-width: 760px; margin: 36px auto; padding: 0 16px; }
      .card { background: white; border-radius: 12px; padding: 36px; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.07); border: 0.5px solid #dde3ea; }
      .page-title { font-size: 1.4rem; color: #1a3a5c; margin-bottom: 6px; }
      .updated { font-size: 12px; color: #aaa; margin-bottom: 28px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; border-bottom: 0.5px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 16px; }
      h2 { font-size: 1rem; color: #1a3a5c; margin: 24px 0 8px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 12px; }
      p { color: #555; line-height: 1.9; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
      footer { text-align: center; color: #aaa; font-size: 12px; padding: 28px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; }
      footer a { color: #aaa; margin: 0 8px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <div class="header-tag">⚖ US Legal Information</div>
      <h1>Legal Rights Explained</h1>
    </header>
    <nav>
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <a href="/about">About</a>
      <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a>
      <a href="/terms">Terms</a>
      <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
    <main>
      <div class="card">
        <h1 class="page-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="updated">Last updated: June 2026</p>

        <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>When you use Legal Rights Explained, we collect only the question you submit and the state you select in order to generate your answer. We do not collect your name, email address, or any personally identifying information unless you contact us directly.</p>

        <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>The information you provide is used solely to generate a relevant answer to your legal question. We do not store your questions after your session ends. We do not sell or share your data with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>

        <h2>Cookies</h2>
        <p>We use standard analytics cookies to understand how visitors use our website. These cookies do not collect personally identifiable information. You may disable cookies in your browser settings at any time without affecting your ability to use the site.</p>

        <h2>Third Party Services</h2>
        <p>We use Google Analytics to understand website traffic patterns. We also use an AI service to generate answers to your questions. These third party services maintain their own privacy policies which we encourage you to review independently.</p>

        <h2>Advertising</h2>
        <p>We use Google AdSense to display relevant advertisements on our website. Google may use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to our website or other websites. You may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting Google's Ads Settings.</p>

        <h2>Data Security</h2>
        <p>We take reasonable precautions to protect your information. However, no method of transmission over the internet is 100% secure. We encourage you to avoid submitting sensitive personal details in your questions.</p>

        <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>Our website is not directed at children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe a child has submitted information to us, please contact us immediately.</p>

        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please reach out to us through our Contact page and we will respond as soon as possible.</p>
      </div>
    </main>
    <footer>
      <p>© 2026 LegalRightsExplained.com — Not a substitute for professional legal advice</p>
      <p style="margin-top:8px;">
        <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
        <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a>
        <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
      </p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>